Fiji/ImageJ lookup tables
-------------------------

This repository bundles Fiji/ImageJ-style lookup table data under:

    assets/colormaps/Fiji/

Fiji and ImageJ are open scientific image processing projects. Fiji is a
"batteries-included" distribution of ImageJ, and its components are distributed
under GPL and other open licenses depending on component:

    https://imagej.net/licensing/
    https://github.com/fiji/fiji

The lookup table names and data in this folder are intended to provide familiar
Fiji/ImageJ visualization options within matlabx.


