matlabx-authored colormaps
--------------------------

This repository includes matlabx-authored colormap data under:

    assets/colormaps/Colors/
    assets/colormaps/Custom/

The Colors maps are simple black-to-color linear RGB gradients. These maps are
part of matlabx and are covered by the matlabx project license.

The MATLAB colormap category exposed by matlabx is generated at runtime from
the user's installed MATLAB built-in colormap functions; matlabx does not
redistribute MathWorks colormap data.


